# Vercel deploys the Next app in apps/web (root directory = apps/web) but the
# CLI uploads the whole workspace so pnpm can resolve it. Everything below is
# irrelevant to the web build — and .anchor/ holds a live validator socket that
# is not a regular file, which is what failed the first deploy (ENXIO).

# Solana / Anchor / Rust — not part of the pnpm workspace
.anchor
target
programs
tests
.devnet
Cargo.lock
Cargo.toml
Anchor.toml

# Build artifacts and deps (Vercel installs + builds fresh)
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next

# VCS and local noise
.git
docs
*.md
HANDOFF.md
